{"id":"056963e1a5e7fa08","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-metric-compact-space.md","title":"ZFC Metric Compact Space","display":"df-zfc-metric-compact-space — ZFC Metric Compact Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-metric-compact-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-metric-compact-space"],"display":"df-zfc-metric-compact-space — ZFC Metric Compact Space","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space]]","[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-metric-compact-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-metric-compact-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-metric-compact-space — ZFC Metric Compact Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"642e1f3e8606bd5d\" href=\"?note=642e1f3e8606bd5d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,d\\in V\">\\(X,d\\in V\\)</span> (metric-space parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S\\)</span> (canonical predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompactSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompactSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompactSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\exists\\tau_d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\tau_d=\\{U\\subseteq X\\mid\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau_d)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompactSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\exists\\tau_d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\tau_d=\\{U\\subseteq X\\mid\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau_d)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Compactness is imposed on the topology generated by the supplied metric; the open-ball condition is expanded so that no unsourced ball operator is required.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space","status":"resolved","id":"642e1f3e8606bd5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompactSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}compact\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompactSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\exists\\tau_d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\tau_d=\\{U\\subseteq X\\mid\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)<\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau_d)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1132,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2683","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-metric-compact-space.md|58-df-zfc-metric-compact-space]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["642e1f3e8606bd5d","ce876585d129ce97"]}